    },
    "organismo_attestazione": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Issuing SOA body (organismo di attestazione)",
      "title": "Organismo Attestazione"
    },
    "numero_attestazione": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Attestation number",
      "title": "Numero Attestazione"
    },
    "categorie": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Qualified categories with their classifica, e.g. ['OG1 III', 'OS6 II']",
      "title": "Categorie"
    },
    "data_emissione": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Issue date exactly as printed (e.g. 08/03/2026) \u2014 do not convert it",
      "title": "Data Emissione"
    },
    "data_scadenza": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Expiry date exactly as printed (e.g. 11/03/2030) \u2014 do not convert it. An SOA lasts 5 years, with a triennial review (verifica triennale) - use the final expiry, and read the review date into 'data_verifica_triennale'.",
      "title": "Data Scadenza"
    },
    "data_verifica_triennale": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Triennial review date exactly as printed (e.g. 11/03/2028) \u2014 do not convert it",
      "title": "Data Verifica Triennale"
    }
  },
  "title": "CertificazioneSOASchema",
  "type": "object"
}

IMPORTANT: All dates MUST be in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DD).

IMPORTANT EXTRACTION RULES FOR ATTESTAZIONE SOA:
- 'categorie': ONE array entry per qualified category, each as 'CODE CLASSIFICA' (e.g. 'OG1 III', 'OS6 II'). Read them from the qualification table; do not merge them into one string.
- 'data_scadenza': the attestation's FINAL expiry (5 years from issue).
- 'data_verifica_triennale': the triennial review deadline, which is EARLIER than the final expiry. Do not confuse the two — a missed triennial review suspends the SOA.
- 'organismo_attestazione': the issuing SOA body's name.

Respond ONLY with the JSON, without additional text.

